# Skeleton Theme Patterns

## Project Identity
- **Text domain**: `'skel'`
- **Function prefix**: `skel_`
- **Tabs** for indentation (all files)

## ACF Block Registration

Add to `functions/register-acf-blocks.php`:

```php
$block_types = array(
	'Hero Slider',
	'New Block Name',  // Add here
);

// If block needs JS:
$blocks_with_js = array(
	'Hero Slider',
	'New Block Name',
);
```

**Auto-generates**:
- `acf-blocks/{slug}.php`
- `src/sass/partials/acf-blocks/_{slug}.scss`
- `src/js/custom/acf-blocks/{slug}.js` (if in `$blocks_with_js`)

## ACF Block Template

```php
<?php
if ( isset( $block['data']['preview_image'] ) ) {
	echo '<img src="' . esc_url( $block['data']['preview_image'] ) . '">';
	return;
}

if ( 'on' !== get_field( 'display' ) ) {
	return;
}

$items = get_field( 'items' );
if ( ! is_array( $items ) || empty( $items ) ) {
	return;
}

$spacing        = get_field( 'spacing' );
$spacing_top    = $spacing['top']['spacing_top'] ?? '';
$spacing_bottom = $spacing['bottom']['spacing_bottom'] ?? '';
$custom_classes = get_field( 'custom_classes' );
$custom_css     = get_field( 'custom_css' );
$unique_id      = get_field( 'unique_id' );
?>

<section
	class="block-section section <?php echo esc_attr( "{$spacing_top} {$spacing_bottom} {$custom_classes}" ); ?>"
	style="<?php echo esc_attr( $custom_css ); ?>"
	id="<?php echo esc_attr( $unique_id ); ?>"
	data-inview>
	<div class="container">
		<?php foreach ( $items as $item ) : ?>
			<!-- Content -->
		<?php endforeach; ?>
	</div>
</section>
```

## HTML Structure

```html
<!-- Sections end with *-section -->
<section class="hero-section">
	<div class="container"></div>
</section>

<!-- Wrappers end with *-block -->
<div class="content-block"></div>

<!-- Image cover pattern -->
<div class="img-cover-block">
	<img src="" class="img-cover" />
</div>
```

## Data Attributes

### Animation
- `data-inview` - Viewport animation trigger
- `data-aos="fade-up"` - Animation type
- `data-aos-stagger-item` - Staggered children

### Toggles
- `data-toggle-click="name"` - Toggle on click
- `data-toggle-group="group"` - Only one active
- `data-toggle-link="name"` - Toggle together
- `data-toggle-hover="name"` - Hover toggle

